  "foaf:name": "The Mantaverse",
  "sdo:name": "The Mantaverse",
  "sdo:description": "The Mantaverse is an artistic, immersive, and educational digital world designed to promote awareness of ocean issues among stakeholders who may not normally engage with relevant content. In the Mantaverse, manta rays function as charismatic ocean ambassadors to teach about current ocean issues including but not limited to IUU fishing, pollution, loss of coral reefs, and loss of biodiversity. This multi-stage project aims to increase ocean literacy and develop cognitive empathy through gameplay, interpersonal connection, dialogue, and immersive 3D imagery.",
